  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 1996, people near the town of Varginha in Brazil said a strange creature had been caught and taken away by the military. According to a documentary filmmaker named James Fox, a military source he calls only \"military X\" told him that everything in the case \"started at my farm\". Fox says he heard this himself while making his film Moment of Contact. If it is true, the source would place the start of the military operation on his own land."
